{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2700705b4d35d54cc558b137b7faede31506b07fd0e0c1c5f53520cfcbb5e09", "ja": "（今日は海美のPV撮影だ。ロリータファッション風の\n衣装……海美にとって、新しい挑戦だな！）", "zh": "（今天海美要拍摄PV。\n萝莉塔风格的服装……对海美来说是全新的挑战！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "2eea5d4e1223a0596b1171110c7701809ef371ffabf4033937c3f19ab8ea7698", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまっ！\nいよいよ撮影だよーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n拍摄就快要开始啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "879d464355b76b1c4e8f6b5634fedd6f3e97dc659d367a8d0565da29b34bb2da", "ja": "こういう衣装でPV撮影なんて、すっごく新鮮！\n{$P$}も、そう思うでしょ？", "zh": "穿这样的服装拍摄PV，感觉好新鲜喔！\n{$P$}也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5a84a623b6c9c80d7b97edba43a47c3ece1bf15279e5f31425a12fd75a485d08", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n海美の新しい挑戦だ、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "嗯，对啊。\n海美，这是你的新挑战，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "8ebc5e2413edb6684768523a09a10e9dda5eb9e745dde4b31984d134dc8d14fd", "ja": "うん、がんばるっ！\n……と、言いたいところなんだけど……。", "zh": "好，我会加油的！\n……话是这么说啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "5d2a8a14f58c00e58a82488c52322258f6f7e5463144e3327524fccb5a0c9e1d", "ja": "こういう衣装でPV撮影するの初めてだから、\nなんか緊張してきちゃって……。", "zh": "我还是第一次穿这种服装拍摄PV，\n总觉得开始紧张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "c9fce3af8a544c98a20225932deec063199aaab22af180108f3c8bdebdd6f4da", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしよう？\n私、どうしたらいいのかな！？　ううっ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么办？\n我该怎么做才好！？呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2535777a6722fbef57e96abd3b43da73ccaa41548553e8b7f459be7c5807bc08", "ja": "大丈夫！　心配しなくても、ちゃんと\n可愛く見えてるよ。それに……。", "zh": "没问题的！你不用担心，\n看起来真的很可爱喔，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d48049be9cde3d40d4c0f5293e922097cac469e5aea1feb6fa8651ca3500474b", "ja": "変に気負うより、自然体の海美でいた方が\nいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不用给自己太多压力，\n海美只要保持自然就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "631306f732c65bc1c312d2cfa68271bd45fa0859f9384c73fe83f825117e76d0", "ja": "自然体……あっ、そっか！\n私、体の柔らかさには自信があるから大丈夫っ☆", "zh": "保持自然……啊，对了！\n我对自己的柔软度很有自信，所以没问题的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "184f8f8bf1faff993f37b0cde64274d59f71c10e53c438b15b46f2af646e8d21", "ja": "え？　いや、そういう事じゃなく……。", "zh": "咦？不对，我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "424e3935e4def5b83cffe6da2fb940ac9531eea5a42faadb7dbde305c82b614a", "ja": "お姫さまっぽい衣装だし、硬いより\n柔らかいほうが、プリンセスって感じがするよね！", "zh": "既然是像公主一样的服装，\n比起僵硬，柔软一点的感觉更合适吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "149217d479cdbdaa36d6d2daafece4fc3a4d5bfb35a833decfcce5b39f1388a8", "ja": "どういう感じなんだ？　いや、それはさておき……\n緊張、少しは解れてきたか？", "zh": "那是什么感觉啊？不对，这不重要……\n有没有比较不紧张了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "93536dd1fbd170e31039606b3e169ae3db0717f72c2f1057b5524f600517fff8", "ja": "あ！　えっと……うんっ、大丈夫！\n{$P$}、ありがとーっ☆", "zh": "啊！呃……嗯！我没事了！\n{$P$}，谢谢你──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b7a0406913888211fbab7bff120804dce33622aaba337a963a107630db94349", "ja": "やっぱり{$P$}はすごいよね！\n私のこと、なんでもわかっちゃうんだな～。", "zh": "{$P$}真的好厉害喔！\n对我简直了若指掌耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "117fb9046ec16d7d282bf9e1fb5f65db162fb97b011f8dab1596b5ca831dcaf3", "ja": "そうだな。でも、わからない事もあるよ。", "zh": "是啊。不过，我也是有不了解的事情喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "c815ced173c9d6f15fc24a292407f38281f7ef8146ed6cd4f5a7a348bc863a30", "ja": "え、そうなの？　たとえば？", "zh": "咦？是吗？比方说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "77f3ff038e8f8a665e4eb4bbed8b4530cd34e8939dbffdf00b4d0c8a49cbc7ff", "ja": "たとえば、海美には可愛い衣装が\nこんなにも似合うんだって事とか。", "zh": "比方说，我没想到海美\n会这么适合可爱的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3624f9ba42b882ff4c4505ed8d63cfe66723cefb443778bcc58c34460b792dcd", "ja": "もちろん、似合うと思ったから選んだんだけど。\nでも、想像以上だったよ。", "zh": "当然，我就是觉得适合你才挑选这套服装的。\n只是，结果超乎我的想像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "14465b439fb6326e08035c073a7b72a12134104cd611e2e40d46e364e52c3863", "ja": "ううっ……{$P$}……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9484855359ef5f1fdee5a7e3003b8a2e5a3f6943a0e142b000c0bb3da956f543", "ja": "あ、ごめん。気に障ったか？", "zh": "啊，抱歉，惹你不高兴了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e7437a5eead5a59e50ca97b946874fdec2ea9489ddcc6efc045a01a8d80cba4", "ja": "違うの！\n……どうしよう！　うれしい！　でも恥ずかしい！", "zh": "不是的！\n……怎么办！？我觉得好开心！可是又好难为情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "e7fca10491a93e66e03b28510a2c79eabd02816d31e922ac964a91dc508ef869", "ja": "ううっ、なんか落ち着かなくなってきちゃった……\nわ、私、腹筋してくる！", "zh": "呜呜，开始觉得坐立难安了……\n我、我去做仰卧起坐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0104_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ffcc49d5c61158303a3bbaaae43f5e51493e8c62ef6fe6a0f11948b4d7371088", "ja": "あっ、海美！？\nせめて、着替えてから行ってくれ……！", "zh": "啊，海美！？\n起码先换掉服装再去啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
